Implemented the `crispin_dragapult_energy_routing` change in `main.py`.

Behavior changed:
- Normal Energy attachments now prefer Fire/Psychic onto the Active or best-prepared Dreepy/Drakloak/Dragapult ex line when that moves it toward Phantom Dive.
